{'symbol': 'FICO', 'date': '2021-06-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'FICO PARTNERS WITH LEADING NATIONAL SMALL BUSINESS ORGANIZATIONS TO EMPOWER ENTREPRENEURS WITH CREDIT EDUCATION', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF. , JUNE 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEADING ANALYTICS SOFTWARE FIRM FICO\xa0(NYSE:FICO), IS PROUD TO ANNOUNCE PARTNERSHIPS WITH PREEMINENT SMALL BUSINESS ORGANIZATIONS, SMALL BUSINESS ROUNDTABLE (SBR), NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF WOMEN BUSINESS OWNERS (NAWBO) AND THE UNITED STATES HISPANIC CHAMBER OF COMMERCE (USHCC), FOR ITS SCORE A BETTER FUTURE PROGRAM TO HELP EMPOWER ENTREPRENEURS WITH ESSENTIAL CREDIT KNOWLEDGE.'}